# Raise Dead's SP$ ChangeZone | Origin$ Graveyard | ValidTgts$ Creature.YouCtrl
# targets a card in the graveyard: Java sets the target zone from Origin$
# (AbilityFactory.adjustChangeZoneTarget, called from ChangeZoneEffect's
# buildSpellAbility), so the spell is castable at the Grizzly Bears in the
# human's graveyard and returns it to hand on resolution.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 B
queue targets 2
castspell human 1
resolvestack
